[statement]
As `a-condition-forbidding-the-package-s-own-name-never-holds`, for a name
the package provides at a version: `b` provides `x` at 1, its condition is
`!x>5` and `e`, and only `e` is installed. Where `b` provides `x` at no
version, it is installed with `e`
(`a-condition-forbidding-a-name-the-package-provides-at-no-version-holds`).

[repository]
P:b
V:1
i:!x>5 e
p:x=1

P:e
V:1

[request]
e

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install e 1
